### 12. Forbidden Patterns - AUTOMATIC REJECTION

- **❌ NO Traditional Mockito**: Using `when().thenReturn()` or `verify()` (must use BDDMockito)
- **❌ NO Arrange/Act/Assert**: Using traditional AAA comments (must use Given/When/Then)
- **❌ NO Missing this.**: Direct instance variable access (must use `this.`)
- **❌ NO JOOQ Query Execution**: Don't test actual JOOQ query execution (test condition generation only)
- **❌ NO Database Testing**: Don't test database interactions (test filter logic only)

